WEBVTT

00:00:00.508 --> 00:00:01.242
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.599 --> 00:00:04.108
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you <b>live</b> in a <b>flat</b>?

00:00:04.443 --> 00:00:07.107
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I <b>don’t</b>. I <b>live</b> in a <b>house</b>.

00:00:09.234 --> 00:00:09.873
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.767
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you <b>have</b> a big <b>family</b>?

00:00:13.168 --> 00:00:15.968
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, I <b>do</b>. I <b>have three sisters</b>.

00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:18.526
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.677 --> 00:00:21.501
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you <b>watch</b> a lot of <b>TV</b>?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.627
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I <b>don’t</b>. I <b>read books</b>.